  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Rinse the Peppadew peppers and remove the seeds and membranes.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the olive oil, onion, garlic, thyme, allspice, and jerk seasoning.",
    "Add the Peppadew peppers to the bowl and toss to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "Transfer the peppers to a cazuela or a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 25 minutes or until the peppers are tender and slightly caramelized.",
    "Stir in the honey and Greek yogurt.",
    "Return the peppers to the oven and roast for an additional 5 minutes or until the yogurt is slightly browned and the peppers are coated.",
    "Garnish with cilantro and serve hot."
  ],
